        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Arthur White, John Sullivan\n- Roles: Ernie Trigg, Derek Trotter, Denzil Tulser\n- TV Series: A Touch of Frost, Only Fools and Horses\n\nFacts:\n- Arthur White was born in 1933 and is an English stage and screen actor.\n- Arthur White is known for playing police archivist Ernie Trigg in the crime drama A Touch of Frost.\n- Arthur White appeared in A Touch of Frost alongside his real-life younger brother.\n- John Sullivan wrote the television series Only Fools and Horses.\n- Derek Trotter is a character in Only Fools and Horses who was known by the nickname Del Boy.\n- Denzil Tulser is a good friend of Derek Trotter in Only Fools and Horses.",
