        "original_id": "5a56c24a-aeb1-5349-a99e-0c925d043db4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Jason, Arthur White, John Sullivan\n- Roles: Derek \"Del Boy\" Trotter, Detective Inspector Jack Frost, Ernie Trigg, Denzil Tulser\n- TV Series: Only Fools and Horses, A Touch of Frost\n\nFacts:\n- Arthur White was born in 1933 and is an English stage and screen actor.\n- Only Fools and Horses is a British television sitcom created and written by John Sullivan.\n- David Jason is best known for portraying Derek \"Del Boy\" Trotter in the BBC comedy series Only Fools and Horses.\n- David Jason is also best known for portraying Detective Inspector Jack Frost in the ITV crime drama A Touch of Frost.\n- Arthur White is the real-life older brother of David Jason.\n- Arthur White is best known for his occasional role as police archivist Ernie Trigg in A Touch of Frost alongside David Jason.\n- Denzil Tulser is a long-distance lorry driver from Liverpool, a good friend of Derek Trotter, and one of Del's victims in dodgy goods deals.",
